Approved: revision 15, 2026-08-03 (27 FRs / 10 NFRs / 49 ACs / 121 normative bullets).

Revision 15 was an alignment change made during the design phase, not new scope: FR-17 gained the
clause it was missing about a repeated registration-extension call, and AC-49 plus the message
counts in AC-43, AC-44 and FR-25.10 followed from it. Re-approved without an independent
